{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a customizable Shopify Featured Product section that visually matches the clean product-card style used in my existing Featured Collection section.
    
    LAYOUT:
    Use a vertically stacked product card layout:
    
    1. Product image at the top
    2. Product title
    3. Dynamic product price
    4. Editable product description
    5. Optional "Learn More" link
    6. Variant selector, when the product has variants
    7. Quantity selector (optional)
    8. Full-width Add to Bag button
    9. Optional icon/benefit row directly below the Add to Bag button
    
    The product image should ALWAYS appear above the product information on both desktop and mobile. Do not use a side-by-side image/content layout.
    
    FEATURED PRODUCT SETTINGS:
    - Product picker
    - Custom section heading
    - Optional section subheading
    - Show/hide product title
    - Show/hide price
    - Show/hide description
    - Show/hide Learn More link
    - Show/hide variant selector
    - Show/hide quantity selector
    - Show/hide Add to Bag button
    - Custom Add to Bag button text
    - Product image size
    - Image aspect ratio
    - Image fit: contain or cover
    - Maximum content/card width
    - Section background color
    - Card background color
    - Text color
    - Button background color
    - Button text color
    - Border color
    - Border radius
    - Section padding
    - Card padding
    - Spacing between elements
    
    PRODUCT CARD STYLE:
    Match the styling and proportions of a Shopify Featured Collection product card rather than a traditional Featured Product section.
    
    Keep the design clean and minimal with:
    - Product image prominently displayed at the top
    - Product information left aligned
    - Consistent spacing
    - Full-width Add to Bag button
    - Responsive sizing
    - No unnecessary borders, shadows, or decorative elements
    
    ICON / BENEFIT ROW:
    Create an optional customizable icon row underneath the Add to Bag button.
    
    Allow the merchant to add up to 4 icon blocks.
    
    Each icon block should have:
    - Image/icon picker
    - Optional heading
    - Optional short text
    - Optional link
    - Adjustable icon size
    
    Add settings for:
    - Number of icons per row
    - Icon alignment
    - Text alignment
    - Gap between icons
    - Top spacing above icon row
    - Icon color when applicable
    - Heading color
    - Text color
    
    On desktop, display the icons horizontally in a single row when space allows.
    
    On mobile, allow the icons to either remain in a row or stack/grid responsively.
    
    FUNCTIONALITY:
    - Use the selected Shopify product's actual product data
    - Price must update when a different variant is selected
    - Variant buttons should update the selected variant correctly
    - Add to Bag must add the currently selected variant
    - Disable unavailable/sold-out variants
    - Update button state for sold-out products
    - Keep all functionality compatible with the Shopify theme cart/cart drawer
    - Do not hard-code product information
    
    MOBILE:
    Maintain the same hierarchy:
    Product image → product information → Add to Bag → icons.
    
    Make all spacing, image sizing, typography, and icon layouts responsive.
    
    The section should be fully customizable through the Shopify Theme Editor without requiring code changes., Move the product title to the top left of the product card.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign featured_product = block.settings.product %}
{% style %}
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 20px; background:{{ block.settings.section_bg }}; color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}; box-sizing:border-box; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { text-align:center; margin:0 0 8px; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subheading { text-align:center; margin:0 0 24px; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { position:relative; max-width:{{ block.settings.card_width }}px; padding:{{ block.settings.card_padding }}px; margin:0 auto; background:{{ block.settings.card_bg }}; border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.border_radius }}px; box-sizing:border-box; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media { width:{{ block.settings.image_size }}%; max-width:100%; margin:0 auto; aspect-ratio:{{ block.settings.image_ratio }}; overflow:hidden; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:{{ block.settings.image_fit }}; display:block; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:#f3f3f3; position:relative; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width:100%; height:100%; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty { position:absolute; bottom:12px; font-size:13px; color:#555; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:{{ block.settings.element_spacing }}px; margin-top:{{ block.settings.element_spacing }}px; text-align:left; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title,.ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { margin:0; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { position:absolute; top:{{ block.settings.card_padding }}px; left:{{ block.settings.card_padding }}px; z-index:1; text-align:left; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description p { margin:0; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__learn { color:inherit; text-underline-offset:3px; width:max-content; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__select,.ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quantity { min-height:44px; padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius:{{ block.settings.border_radius }}px; color:inherit; background:{{ block.settings.card_bg }}; font:inherit; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quantity { width:88px; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__submit { width:100%; min-height:48px; padding:12px 18px; border:0; border-radius:{{ block.settings.border_radius }}px; background:{{ block.settings.button_bg }}; color:{{ block.settings.button_text }}; font:inherit; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__submit:disabled { opacity:.55; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefits { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat({{ block.settings.icons_per_row }},minmax(0,1fr)); gap:{{ block.settings.icon_gap }}px; margin-top:{{ block.settings.icon_top_spacing }}px; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit { text-align:{{ block.settings.icon_text_alignment }}; color:{{ block.settings.benefit_text_color }}; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon { height:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px; width:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px; object-fit:contain; display:block; margin:0 auto 8px; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit-heading { color:{{ block.settings.benefit_heading_color }}; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 4px; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit-copy { margin:0; }
  .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status { min-height:1em; }
  @media(max-width:749px) { .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:100%; padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding | times: 0.7 }}px 16px; } .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { padding:{{ block.settings.card_padding | times: 0.75 }}px; } .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title { top:{{ block.settings.card_padding | times: 0.75 }}px; left:{{ block.settings.card_padding | times: 0.75 }}px; } .ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefits--stack { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
{% endstyle %}
<featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    {% if block.settings.section_heading != blank %}<h2 class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.section_heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.section_subheading != blank %}<div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__subheading">{{ block.settings.section_subheading | escape }}</div>{% endif %}
    {% if featured_product != blank %}
      <div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
        {% if block.settings.show_title %}<h3 class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ featured_product.title | escape }}</h3>{% endif %}
        <div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">
          {% if featured_product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ featured_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ featured_product.featured_image.alt | default: featured_product.title | escape }}" width="{{ featured_product.featured_image.width }}" height="{{ featured_product.featured_image.height }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Choose a product image</span></div>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <form class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info" data-product-form>
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ featured_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" data-variant-id>
          {% if block.settings.show_price %}<div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price" data-price>{{ featured_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money }}</div>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_description %}<div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{% if block.settings.custom_description != blank %}{{ block.settings.custom_description }}{% else %}{{ featured_product.description }}{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_learn_more %}<a class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__learn" href="{{ featured_product.url }}">{{ block.settings.learn_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_variants and featured_product.variants.size > 1 %}<label for="ai-variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Choose an option</label><select id="ai-variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__select" data-variant-select aria-label="Choose a product variant">{% for variant in featured_product.variants %}<option value="{{ variant.id }}" data-price="{{ variant.price | money | escape }}" data-available="{{ variant.available }}" {% if variant.id == featured_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id %}selected{% endif %} {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>{{ variant.title | escape }}{% unless variant.available %} — Sold out{% endunless %}</option>{% endfor %}</select>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_quantity %}<label for="ai-quantity-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Quantity</label><input id="ai-quantity-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quantity" type="number" name="quantity" min="1" value="1">{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.show_button %}<button class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__submit" type="submit" data-submit {% unless featured_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>{% if featured_product.available %}{{ block.settings.button_label | escape }}{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}</button>{% endif %}
          <div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status" data-status aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
        {% if block.settings.show_benefits %}<div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefits {% if block.settings.mobile_icon_layout == 'stack' %}ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefits--stack{% endif %}" style="text-align:{{ block.settings.icon_alignment }}">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% assign image_key = 'benefit_' | append: i | append: '_image' %}{% assign head_key = 'benefit_' | append: i | append: '_heading' %}{% assign copy_key = 'benefit_' | append: i | append: '_text' %}{% assign link_key = 'benefit_' | append: i | append: '_link' %}{% assign benefit_image = block.settings[image_key] %}{% assign benefit_heading = block.settings[head_key] %}{% assign benefit_text = block.settings[copy_key] %}{% assign benefit_link = block.settings[link_key] %}{% if benefit_image != blank or benefit_heading != blank or benefit_text != blank %}<div class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit">{% if benefit_link != blank %}<a href="{{ benefit_link }}">{% endif %}{% if benefit_image %}<img class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" src="{{ benefit_image | image_url: width: 200 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{% if benefit_heading != blank %}<p class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit-heading">{{ benefit_heading | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% if benefit_text != blank %}<p class="ai-featured-{{ ai_gen_id }}__benefit-copy">{{ benefit_text | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% if benefit_link != blank %}</a>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
    {% else %}<p>Select a product in the block settings.</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>
(function () {
  const tag = 'featured-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}';

  if (customElements.get(tag)) return;

  class FeaturedProduct extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback() {
      this.form = this.querySelector('[data-product-form]');
      if (!this.form) return;

      this.select = this.querySelector('[data-variant-select]');
      this.idInput = this.querySelector('[data-variant-id]');
      this.price = this.querySelector('[data-price]');
      this.button = this.querySelector('[data-submit]');
      this.status = this.querySelector('[data-status]');

      if (this.select) {
        this.select.addEventListener('change', () => {
          this.changeVariant();
        });
      }

      this.form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
        this.addToCart(event);
      });
    }

    changeVariant() {
      const option = this.select.selectedOptions[0];

      this.idInput.value = option.value;

      if (this.price) {
        this.price.textContent = option.dataset.price;
      }

      if (this.button) {
        this.button.disabled =
          option.dataset.available !== 'true';

        this.button.textContent =
          this.button.disabled
            ? 'Sold out'
            : {{ block.settings.button_label | json }};
      }

      if (this.status) {
        this.status.textContent = '';
      }
    }

    async addToCart(event) {
      event.preventDefault();

      if (!this.button || this.button.disabled) return;

      this.button.disabled = true;

      if (this.status) {
        this.status.textContent = 'Adding…';
      }

      try {
        const root =
          window.Shopify &&
          Shopify.routes &&
          Shopify.routes.root
            ? Shopify.routes.root
            : '/';

        const cartDrawer =
          document.querySelector('cart-drawer');

        /*
         * Use the existing product form so the selected
         * variant and quantity are preserved.
         */
        const formData = new FormData(this.form);

        /*
         * Request the exact sections Luxe's native
         * cart drawer needs.
         */
        if (
          cartDrawer &&
          typeof cartDrawer.getSectionsToRender === 'function'
        ) {
          const sections = cartDrawer
            .getSectionsToRender()
            .map((section) => section.id);

          formData.append(
            'sections',
            sections.join(',')
          );

          formData.append(
            'sections_url',
            window.location.pathname
          );
        }

        const response = await fetch(
          root + 'cart/add.js',
          {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: {
              'Accept': 'application/json'
            },
            body: formData
          }
        );

        const result = await response.json();

        if (!response.ok) {
          throw new Error(
            result.description ||
            result.message ||
            'Unable to add this item.'
          );
        }

        /*
         * Update and open Luxe's native cart drawer.
         */
        if (
          cartDrawer &&
          typeof cartDrawer.renderContents === 'function' &&
          result.sections
        ) {
          cartDrawer.renderContents(result);

          /*
           * Remove the empty-cart state so the
           * newly added product is visible.
           */
          if (cartDrawer.classList.contains('is-empty')) {
            cartDrawer.classList.remove('is-empty');
          }
        }

        if (this.status) {
          this.status.textContent = 'Added to bag';
        }

      } catch (error) {
        console.error(
          'Featured Product add to cart error:',
          error
        );

        if (this.status) {
          this.status.textContent =
            error.message ||
            'Unable to add this item.';
        }

      } finally {
        if (this.button) {
          const option =
            this.select
              ? this.select.selectedOptions[0]
              : null;

          this.button.disabled =
            option
              ? option.dataset.available !== 'true'
              : false;

          if (!this.button.disabled) {
            this.button.textContent =
              {{ block.settings.button_label | json }};
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }

  customElements.define(tag, FeaturedProduct);
})();
</script>
{% schema %}
{
  "name":"Featured product card",
  "settings":[
    {"type":"product","id":"product","label":"Product"},
    {"type":"text","id":"section_heading","label":"Section heading","default":"Featured product"},
    {"type":"text","id":"section_subheading","label":"Section subheading"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_title","label":"Show product title","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_price","label":"Show price","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_description","label":"Show description","default":true},
    {"type":"richtext","id":"custom_description","label":"Custom description"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_learn_more","label":"Show Learn More link","default":false},
    {"type":"text","id":"learn_label","label":"Learn More text","default":"Learn more"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_variants","label":"Show variant selector","default":true},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_quantity","label":"Show quantity selector","default":false},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"show_button","label":"Show Add to Bag button","default":true},
    {"type":"text","id":"button_label","label":"Button text","default":"Add to Bag"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_width","label":"Maximum card width","min":300,"max":900,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":600},
    {"type":"range","id":"image_size","label":"Image width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"select","id":"image_ratio","label":"Image aspect ratio","options":[{"value":"1 / 1","label":"Square"},{"value":"4 / 5","label":"Portrait"},{"value":"3 / 2","label":"Landscape"},{"value":"auto","label":"Natural"}],"default":"1 / 1"},
    {"type":"select","id":"image_fit","label":"Image fit","options":[{"value":"contain","label":"Contain"},{"value":"cover","label":"Cover"}],"default":"contain"},
    {"type":"color","id":"section_bg","label":"Section background","default":"#FFFFFF"},
    {"type":"color","id":"card_bg","label":"Card background","default":"#FFFFFF"},
    {"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text color","default":"#000000"},
    {"type":"color","id":"button_bg","label":"Button background","default":"#000000"},
    {"type":"color","id":"button_text","label":"Button text color","default":"#FFFFFF"},
    {"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Border color","default":"#DDDDDD"},
    {"type":"range","id":"border_radius","label":"Border radius","min":0,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":0},
    {"type":"range","id":"section_padding","label":"Section padding","min":0,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":30},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_padding","label":"Card padding","min":0,"max":50,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":10},
    {"type":"range","id":"element_spacing","label":"Element spacing","min":4,"max":32,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":12},
    {"type":"header","content":"Benefit icons"},
